 "result": "In `src/tessel/helpers.py:395-396`, `get_flashed_messages` filters with:\n\n```python\nif category_filter:\n    flashes = list(filter(lambda f: f[0] in category_filter, flashes))\n```\n\n- Each flash is a `(category, message)` tuple, so it keeps those whose category (`f[0]`) is in `category_filter`.\n- An empty `category_filter` (the default) skips filtering.\n- Filtering happens after the flashes are popped from the session and cached on `app_ctx._flashes`, so later calls in the same request see the full cached list and filter it again.\n- `with_categories` only affects output shape: tuples if `True`, message strings only if `False`.",
